>; <math alttext=\"4,050\"><mn>4,050</mn>\n</math>; <math alttext=\"3,050\"><mn>3,050</mn>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the mean mass, in grams, of these <math alttext=\"5\"><mn>5</mn>\n</math> alpine marmots?&nbsp;</p>","type":"spr","correct_answer":["3630"]},"createDate":1730147357404,"updateDate":1730147357404}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1730147357404, 1730147357404),
